  "notes": [
    "Popup and deployment finish: complete rectangular chrome replaces ornamental/shadow alpha; all eight native image sizes, frame counts and effects stay unchanged.",
    "Headers close at local y64, before the paper/focus client areas start at GUI y75/y72. Footer chrome starts at local y8, preserving body caption space while keeping native button positions.",
    "Ordinary/obsolete division cards share a 346x78 visible frame. The obsolete 348x79 atlas retains two transparent right columns and one bottom alignment row. It keeps a warm face and amber stripe, distinct from silver/white normal cards.",
    "Agency ornament and, at the user request, the focus laurels/metal face are replaced by white client fields. The dynamic focus symbol remains original. Focus client ends at local y125 (GUI y197), where the footer begins.",
    "The priority strip has a blank middle frame and upper/lower arrow pixels within a 52px canvas. Its original position is retained on the silver/cream lane; do not place a short empty input field behind it."
  ],
